    "text": "Evansville\nBuild Community and Share Freely at EVPL This Summer\nBy Kat Mykals,\n3 hours agoFree Community Share days are coming to one Evansville-Vanderburgh Public Library location, and you're invited to attend!. The EVPL recognizes the power of the Evansville community and will be hosting a Free Community Share event. The event will provide a space for sharing recipes, local art, fresh flowers, and fresh produce with others.",
